To turn a species (text) at an x (number) by a y (number):
  If the species is "Bulbasaur":
    Rearbulbasaur at the x by the y.
  If the species is "Ivysaur":
    Rearivysaur at the x by the y.
  If the species is "Venusaur":
    Rearvenusaur at the x by the y.
  If the species is "Charmander":
    Rearcharmander at the x by the y.
  If the species is "Charmeleon":
    Rearcharmeleon at the x by the y.
  If the species is "Charizard":
    Rearcharizard at the x by the y.
  If the species is "Squirtle":
    Rearsquirtle at the x by the y.
  If the species is "Wartortle":
    Rearwartortle at the x by the y.
  If the species is "Blastoise":
    Rearblastoise at the x by the y.
